  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afghanistan Land Administration System Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is (a) to support the development of the Afghanistan land administration system; and (b) to provide the population in selected areas with improved land registration services, including issuance of Titles and Occupancy Certificates.</narrative>
  </description>
